  data: {
    LLM: '1. Blinds posted (small and big blind). 2. Each player receives four hole cards. 3. First betting round (pre-flop). 4. Dealer burns one card and deals three community cards (flop). 5. Second betting round. 6. Burn and deal one card (turn). 7. Third betting round. 8. Burn and deal one card (river). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: each active player must use exactly two hole cards and exactly three board cards to make their best hand.',
    Player: '1. Blinds posted (small and big blind). 2. Each player receives four hole cards. 3. First betting round (pre-flop). 4. Dealer burns one card and deals three community cards (flop). 5. Second betting round. 6. Burn and deal one card (turn). 7. Third betting round. 8. Burn and deal one card (river). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: each active player must use exactly two hole cards and exactly three board cards to make their best hand.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the best five-card hand at showdown, using exactly two hole cards and exactly three board cards.',
    gameplay: '1. Blinds posted (small and big blind). 2. Each player receives four hole cards. 3. First betting round (pre-flop). 4. Dealer burns one card and deals three community cards (flop). 5. Second betting round. 6. Burn and deal one card (turn). 7. Third betting round. 8. Burn and deal one card (river). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: each active player must use exactly two hole cards and exactly three board cards to make their best hand.',
    keyRules: [
      'Exactly two hole cards and exactly three board cards must be usedâ€”no more, no fewer.',
